# ENGLISH-ONLY DOCUMENTATION

- All Cursor rules (`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`) MUST be written in English.
- All Markdown documentation MUST be written in English, including but not limited to:
  - `README.md`
  - `TECHNICAL.md`
  - `FUNCTIONAL.md`
  - Any other `.md` file in the repository.
- When creating or updating rules or documentation, use clear, professional English.
- Do not write new rules or Markdown docs in French or any other language unless the user explicitly requests otherwise.
